  "schema_version": "launchclip.narration.v1",
  "text": "Orbital just raised 40 million dollars, and the price of its launch tier dropped the same day. The round was led by Northwind, its first investor. The new tier starts at 19 dollars a month, down from 29. Three things changed: the price, the build queue, and the free plan. Builds that took nine minutes now take four. The free plan keeps every feature, with a cap of 200 builds a month. That is the bet: cheaper builds bring bigger teams.",
